OL,3,GNEWSAMet chief urges care over football
OL,4,Amatch alcohol
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Police Commissioner has warned
OL,7,Fthat any proposal to allow football
OL,8,Ffans to drink alcohol in the stands
OL,9,Fshould be considered "really
OL,10,Fcarefully".
OL,12,FLaws which prevent drinking in view of
OL,13,Fthe pitch at stadiums for clubs in the
OL,14,Ftop five tiers of men's football in
OL,15,FEngland were introduced in 1985, when
OL,16,Fthe then-home secretary suggested
OL,17,Falcohol was a "major contributory
OL,18,Ffactor in violent and disorderly
OL,19,Fbehaviour" in the grounds.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
