OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet chief urges care over football
OL,4,Amatch alcohol
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the prime minister recently
OL,7,Fsaid current "legislation dates to an
OL,8,Fera where football was very different".
OL,10,FSir Mark Rowley told the London
OL,11,FAssembly he was concerned about
OL,12,Fviolence and drug abuse at football
OL,13,Fmatches and any further "loosening" of
OL,14,Fregulations.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
